                                                "example_id": "427f15ae-75dd-4fac-a4cc-6895d98e9630",
                                                "sense_id": "ad16a925-6653-39e4-8fad-b35bb44f397c",
                                                "text": "The San Jose-based online video provider has said it was tightening the platform's security to help prevent instances of video conferences being interrupted by Zoombombing incidents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd41a957-cd18-4f4b-a81d-9e5feefdcf53",
                                                "sense_id": "ad16a925-6653-39e4-8fad-b35bb44f397c",
                                                "text": "“I went in terrified about a Zoombombing,” Mr. Leitschuh said. “I'd seen the same media coverage everyone else did.” But he said: “For this use case, I wasn’t aware of a better platform.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
